<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <%- include('../partials/head', { title: 'Erro 500 - Servidor' }) %>
</head>
<body class="error-page">
  <div class="error-container">
    <div class="error-content">
      <h1>500</h1>
      <h2>Erro no Servidor</h2>
      <p>Ocorreu um erro interno no servidor. Tente novamente mais tarde.</p>
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Voltar ao Início</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <style>
    .error-page {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .error-container {
      text-align: center;
      color: white;
      padding: 40px;
    }
    .error-content h1 {
      font-size: 120px;
      margin: 0;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }
    .error-content h2 {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .error-content p {
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 30px;
      background: white;
      color: #667eea;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      font-weight: bold;
      transition: transform 0.2s;
    }
    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }
  </style>
</body>
</html>
